  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohammad Naushad vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 8 May, 2023 Author: Surya Prakash Kesarwani Bench: Surya Prakash Kesarwani High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2023:Ahc:98391-Db Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 7136 of 2023 Petitioner :- Mohammad Naushad Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others",
    "facts": "The impugned order dated 11.02.2021 under Section 26(2) Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act, 2006') is appealable under Section 70 of the Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the appellate tribunal for the purposes of Section 70(1) of the Act, 2006 has not been constituted so far in the State of Uttar Pradesh. Considering the statement made by learned counsel for the petitioner, we direct the respondent no.1 to file a short counter affidavit stating therein as to whether a tribunal for the purposes of Section 70(1) of the Act, 2006 has been constituted?",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the appellate tribunal for the purposes of Section 70(1) of the Act, 2006 has not been constituted so far in the State of Uttar Pradesh. Considering the statement made by learned counsel for the petitioner, we direct the respondent no.1 to file a short counter affidavit stating therein as to whether a tribunal for the purposes of Section 70(1) of the Act, 2006 has been constituted?",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
